slot 308 0           native   INDEX_CONVOLVER_GAIN kConvolverGain convolverGain (IR gain / headroom trim, dB, -30..+12)

section Crossover bypass and measurement neutral (added in the 309 -> 312 growth)
slot 309 0           native   INDEX_CROSSOVER_BYPASS kCrossoverBypass crossoverBypass (1 = band split removed: one full-range path, zero added latency)
slot 310 0           native   INDEX_MEASUREMENT_NEUTRAL kMeasurementNeutral measurementNeutral (1 = every stage in the neutral set bypassed by native; saved settings untouched)
slot 311 0           native   INDEX_NEUTRAL_ALLOW kNeutralAllow neutralAllow (bitmask of kStage* bits kept running while measurementNeutral is on)

section Structure
const kStagePreEq 0 stage bit: the full-range (Pre) PEQ bank and its preamp
const kStageCrossover 1 stage bit: the band split (crossovers, band chains, band sum)
const kStageBandEq 2 stage bit: the Low/Mid/High PEQ banks
const kStageBandGain 3 stage bit: per-band driver gains
const kStageBandDelay 4 stage bit: per-band alignment delays
const kStagePolarity 5 stage bit: per-output polarity inversion
const kStageAllPass 6 stage bit: per-output all-pass sections
const kStageSubsonic 7 stage bit: Low's subsonic high-pass
const kStageRouting 8 stage bit: a non-identity routing matrix
const kStageBusLimiter 9 stage bit: the per-band bus limiters
const kStageMonoBass 10 stage bit: Mono Bass
const kStageVirtualCentre 11 stage bit: the virtual-centre stage
const kStageVirtualBass 12 stage bit: Virtual Bass
const kStageMbc 13 stage bit: the multiband compressor
const kStageTilt 14 stage bit: tilt
const kStageConvolver 15 stage bit: the convolver (on with an IR loaded)
const kStageMasterLimiter 16 stage bit: the master limiter
const kStageLoudness 17 stage bit: loudness compensation
const kStageHeadroom 18 stage bit: headroom (manual or automatic)
const kStagePostGain 19 stage bit: post gain L/R
const kStageDcBlocker 20 stage bit: the 3 Hz input DC blocker
const kStageMeasurementMute 21 stage bit: measurement mute (band isolation)
const kStageNeutralCount 22 bits 0..21 are the stages measurement neutral bypasses
const kStageChannelMute 22 stage bit (report only): channel mute
const kStageSignalGenerator 23 stage bit (report only): the built-in signal generator
const kRoutingStride 2
const kAllPassSectionWidth 4
const kAllPassSectionsPerOutput 2
const kOutputConfigWidth 13
const kOutCrossoverFreq 0
const kOutCrossoverType 1
const kOutSubsonicEnabled 2
const kOutSubsonicFreq 3
const kOutMuted 4
const kOutPolarityInverted 5
const kOutCompressor 6 start of the 7-value compressor tuple
const kMbcBandWidth 8
const kMbcBandCount 4
const kMbcBandEnabled 0
const kMbcBandThreshold 1
const kMbcBandRatio 2
const kMbcBandKnee 3
const kMbcBandAttack 4
const kMbcBandRelease 5
const kMbcBandMakeup 6
const kMbcBandStereoLink 7
const kMidUpperXoWidth 2
const kMidUpperXoFreq 0
const kMidUpperXoEnabled 1
const kHighRoutingStride 2
const kVirtualFeedBase 273
const kVirtualFeedWidth 7
const kVirtualFeedGain 0
const kVirtualFeedDelay 1
const kVirtualFeedPolarity 2
const kVirtualFeedApEnabled 3
const kVirtualFeedApFreq 4
const kVirtualFeedApQ 5
const kVirtualFeedApOrder 6
